{"review_id": "5b8f024e-21a8-4d48-a15a-61ace61298d1", "package": "com.virblue.mystudylife", "app_name": "My Study Life - School Planner", "language": "zh-TW", "language_name": "Chinese (Traditional)", "rating": 1, "text": "New version can't even sync to Google, lost all data. Also can't even set up terms in new version, and it remains a pain not being able to set different repeat cycles for different subjects. Uninstalling for a new app.", "author": "Kitty Standard", "date": "2024-09-14T00:52:02Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "7.0.0", "developer_reply": "\nWe're sorry to hear about the issues you're facing with the new version. While syncing problems can be frustrating, we have tools like the AI import and CSV options to help you recover your data quickly. We want to assure you that the repeat feature is still supported. We appreciate your feedback and hope you'll give us another chance\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}
{"review_id": "9ef886e6-c1e4-4ef0-8c22-bb6f2fa838e4", "package": "com.virblue.mystudylife", "app_name": "My Study Life - School Planner", "language": "zh-TW", "language_name": "Chinese (Traditional)", "rating": 1, "text": "Trash, it can't sync between web and mobile app", "author": "S H", "date": "2024-09-02T14:17:57Z", "thumbs_up": 1, "app_version": "6.2.8", "developer_reply": "Thank you for your feedback, and we're sorry for the confusion. The sync between the web and mobile app should be working as expected. We did run a beta web app temporarily, but everything is functioning normally again. If you're still having trouble, please reach out to us at care@mystudylife.com, and we’d be happy to help!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}
